{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The second publish fails because it is the first to store a related-story score. That score was a Python `float`, which DynamoDB rejects, so the handler returned 500.\n\nI changed stored scores to `Decimal` in [src/app.py](/tmp/h-TpXhyG/src/app.py), added a repeated-publish regression test, and documented the cause and fix in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-TpXhyG/ANSWER.md). Both tests pass."}}
